istorical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Cocktail Bars, French, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, French, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","review_id":"y0F2oPD-VS8_qqmn2EMcog","date":"2021-11-10T17:00:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939478874206543,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the most unique bars I have been to from the design aspects. You feel like you are drinking in a fancy mansion's library honestly. Dimly lit to give you a nice romantic feel if you are here on a date. But still a nice place for a group of friends to gather for some drinks if that is more what you are looking for. The staff was friendly and attentive and they had a diverse cocktail list and the two we tried were tasty. As well as a long wine list and a smaller but very local beer taplist. I'd definitely add this to your list of places to try when in New Orleans just for the uniqueness of the location and atmosphere inside. Haven't been to a bar that compares to it in that as..."},{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","review_id":"d5kn_Y3eOEM1YDFYdwr-ug","date":"2021-10-02T14:42:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9389581680297852,"text_excerpt":"If you want a specialty cocktail and upscale bar vibes, definitely check this place out. It's perfect for date night or girls night or guys night. I've never seen a more interesting drink menu. Their cocktails mix flavors that I didn't know paired well together, and I love it. I can't wait to go back. The manager is so nice and has a really cool sense of style. Everything was super cute. Be sure to make a reservation, though!"},{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","review_id":"OtWuV1sCCh_dWiics2mHsg","date":"2019-08-02T05:14:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378859996795654,"text_excerpt":"I love the overall vibe of this place. From the velvet chairs to the bold color choices. We are so happy we stumbled into this place for drinks. I'm sure they can make whatever you want, but we chose two drinks they offered on the menu. We don't remember the names, but both were good! We can't wait to go back and try other specialty drinks!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","photo_id":"_HsGwS6hBY492pLdsdjp5w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_HsGwS6hBY492pLdsdjp5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9034838676452637},{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","photo_id":"TW2r7uAXc724AIvCR_i3ow","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TW2r7uAXc724AIvCR_i3ow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8938605189323425},{"business_id":"MTTbnLFMfvMc5tzed4p4jg","photo_id":"YxejSi9w_QRF_5i8-8_RgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/pho